<title>UK: Frankfurter Hypo sets 250 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Frankfurter Hypo sets 250 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SGZ Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANKFURTER HYPOTHEKENBANK CENTRALBODEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.375    MATURITY   *17.FEB.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.945   PAY DATE    17.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.125     LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO FEBRUARY 1999, THEN 6.0 PCT IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 709</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
